No more storage space available for extending an internal table.

What happened?
The internal table "LT_BILLING_ITEMS" could not be enlarged, because the required space
exceeds the maximum limit allowed for internal tables. The current ABAP program had to be
terminated as a result.

What can you do?
Note which actions and input led to the error.
For further help in analyzing the problem, contact your SAP administrator.
You can use the ABAP dump analysis transaction ST22 to view and manage termination messages,
in particular for long term reference.

